        "language": "english",
        "review": "A very fun and charming exploration platformer! The highlight of the game is the movement with the drill. It feels really good and exploring was a lot more fun than I expected! Combat was a little rough but some bosses were cleverly designed and a blast once you learned their patterns, especially Mizu. I think Zephyra and Alan's fights could be a tad shorter, they feel longer than the other bosses in the game.\r\n\r\nThere may be a few minor bugs but that never ruined the experience for me! One of the Diamond Trio bosses involved shattering glass and each hit did cause the game to lag/freeze for a bit, making the fight a bit easier than intended I think, so I hope that gets addressed in a future patch.\r\n\r\nOtherwise its a great game worth checking out!",
